id: zoom-locked-pinch-off
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: T-644: with "Allow zoom on every page" off, the zoom-locked page keeps the scale it asks for under a pinch
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-locked.html
prefs: jihad.zoom.allowEveryPage=false
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R5
wait rect 'sel:h1' 30
# no calibrate: a page that says user-scalable=no and fits the card gets the finger's input as mouse events
# (BrowserAdapter::shouldPassInputEvents, the stock rule for maps and games), so a tap logs no clickAt; the pinch needs none
pinch 384 500 150 400
wait settled 6
expect zoom 1.0 0.05
